---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10floorlock">
  <div class="sbp10floorlock-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 294" role="img" aria-label="FLC on 25 and 28 to 31 March 2022: from 28 March the price opened, traded high, low and closed at the floor every day (13,600, 12,650, 11,800, 11,000 VND) on volume of 5.1, 3.2, 0.9 and 1.5 million shares against 14.7 million on 25 March.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Four sessions locked at the floor: the written stop could not be filled at its price</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bốn phiên khóa sàn: lệnh cắt lỗ đã viết không thể khớp đúng giá</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="48" width="164" height="236" rx="8" class="card" />
      <text x="102.0" y="72" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>25 Mar 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>25/3/2022</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="98" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Close 14,600</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa 14.600</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="118" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>0.0%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,0%</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="140" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>trades in a range</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khớp trong một biên giá</tspan></text>
      <rect x="78.0" y="182.0" width="48" height="80.0" class="bar-mut" />
      <text x="102.0" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Volume 14.68M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng 14,68 tr</tspan></text>
      <rect x="194" y="48" width="164" height="236" rx="8" class="card-red" />
      <text x="276.0" y="72" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>28 Mar 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>28/3/2022</tspan></text>
      <text x="276.0" y="98" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Close 13,600</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa 13.600</tspan></text>
      <text x="276.0" y="118" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-6.8% vs 25 Mar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-6,8% so với 25/3</tspan></text>
      <text x="276.0" y="140" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>open = high = low = close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mở = cao = thấp = đóng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="252.0" y="234.2" width="48" height="27.8" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="276.0" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Volume 5.11M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng 5,11 tr</tspan></text>
      <rect x="368" y="48" width="164" height="236" rx="8" class="card-red" />
      <text x="450.0" y="72" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>29 Mar 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>29/3/2022</tspan></text>
      <text x="450.0" y="98" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Close 12,650</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa 12.650</tspan></text>
      <text x="450.0" y="118" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-13.4% vs 25 Mar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-13,4% so với 25/3</tspan></text>
      <text x="450.0" y="140" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>open = high = low = close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mở = cao = thấp = đóng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="426.0" y="244.3" width="48" height="17.7" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="450.0" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Volume 3.25M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng 3,25 tr</tspan></text>
      <rect x="542" y="48" width="164" height="236" rx="8" class="card-red" />
      <text x="624.0" y="72" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>30 Mar 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>30/3/2022</tspan></text>
      <text x="624.0" y="98" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Close 11,800</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa 11.800</tspan></text>
      <text x="624.0" y="118" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-19.2% vs 25 Mar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-19,2% so với 25/3</tspan></text>
      <text x="624.0" y="140" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>open = high = low = close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mở = cao = thấp = đóng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="600.0" y="257.3" width="48" height="4.7" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="624.0" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Volume 0.87M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng 0,87 tr</tspan></text>
      <rect x="716" y="48" width="164" height="236" rx="8" class="card-red" />
      <text x="798.0" y="72" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>31 Mar 2022</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>31/3/2022</tspan></text>
      <text x="798.0" y="98" class="b" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Close 11,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa 11.000</tspan></text>
      <text x="798.0" y="118" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>-24.7% vs 25 Mar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>-24,7% so với 25/3</tspan></text>
      <text x="798.0" y="140" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>open = high = low = close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mở = cao = thấp = đóng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="774.0" y="253.8" width="48" height="8.2" class="bar-red" />
      <text x="798.0" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Volume 1.51M</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng 1,51 tr</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Daily open, high, low, close and volume from SSI iBoard chart history. A stop at -10% (13,140 VND) was passed on the 29th, and the price stayed at the floor all day.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá mở, cao, thấp, đóng và khối lượng từng ngày từ lịch sử biểu đồ SSI iBoard. Giá cắt lỗ -10% (13.140 đồng) bị vượt ngày 29/3, và giá nằm sàn cả ngày.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10floorlock { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10floorlock-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10floorlock svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10floorlock text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10floorlock .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10floorlock .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10floorlock .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10floorlock .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10floorlock .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10floorlock .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10floorlock .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10floorlock .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10floorlock .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10floorlock .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10floorlock .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10floorlock .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10floorlock .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10floorlock .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10floorlock .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10floorlock .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10floorlock .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10floorlock .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10floorlock .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10floorlock .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10floorlock .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10floorlock .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10floorlock .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10floorlock .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10floorlock figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
